{
  "about": "Scenarios of the line's dialog stand (scripts/zeytun-line/dialog-stand.ts). The caller speaks Azerbaijani, as pharmacies do. A turn is the caller's words, or {say, when: [{match, say}]}: the first rule whose match (regex, case-insensitive) fits the assistant's last reply decides, else say. Regexes of checks run on the assistant's replies or on a tool call's JSON args. expectedFail: the line does not have it yet; such a scenario is reported but not fixed here. Products are chosen on the 2026-11-03 snapshot: Adefa №30 has buy 5 get 1 until 2026-11-30, Ketonal cream 50 g and gel buy 10 get 2 until 2026-11-30, Fluimucil is not in the catalog while A.C.C. long 600 effervescent is. history: what the stand's CRM answers to `history:` (pharmacyHistory); a line with find is the snapshot's first candidate for it, a line with name is a product the catalog no longer has (unavailable). 10: Bisakodil is Hemopharma's, whose Omnitus syrup has buy 10 get 1 until 2026-12-01 on the 2026-11-04 00:00 snapshot. 11 runs on a later snapshot with --departed-from the 00:00 one: Klariks 500 mg sold out in between, Klamicin 500 mg (the same clarithromycin tablets) is in stock.",
